# scripts/.scripts-ao-invocations-baseline
# FILENAME-pinned allowlist for check-scripts-ao-invocations.sh (age-owcs).
#
# Each line is an EXECUTABLE script/test that currently invokes a removed/renamed
# ao subcommand at a command position (the stale-retired-surface class). The gate
# fails if a NON-baselined script invokes a dead command, AND fails if a baselined
# file no longer triggers ANY finding (prune it — the allowlist only shrinks).
# Burn a file down (use the live subcommand, delete the dead call, or add the
# `# ao-resolve: ignore` pragma to a deliberate bad-command line), then delete its
# line here.
#
# Seeded 2026-07-04 from the current tree; every entry below is a REAL current
# offender being grandfathered (not a false positive):
#   scripts/install.sh           — `ao hooks install --force` (3.0 is hookless)
#   scripts/nightly-evolution.sh — `ao daemon jobs ...` (no in-repo daemon, ADR-0009)
scripts/install.sh
scripts/nightly-evolution.sh
